Package: RcmdrShinyPlugin.DoE
Type: Package
Title: Design of Experiments for RcmdrShiny
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("RcmdrShiny", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "vigliafg@gmail.com"),
    person("Ulrike", "Grömping", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of RcmdrPlugin.DoE")
  )
Description: RcmdrShiny dialogs for creating, inspecting, modifying and
    analysing experimental designs: screening, fractional factorial, full
    factorial, orthogonal arrays, central composite, Box-Behnken, latin
    hypercube and D-optimal designs.  Derived from RcmdrPlugin.DoE 0.12-6.
